	<section_number>38.2-4207</section_number>
	<catch_line>Existing foreign nonstock corporation</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any foreign nonstock corporation licensed in the Commonwealth as of July 1, 1980, may conduct a plan directly.
	</text>
